	(text "Flash, LEDs, buttons, SWD. Copied from DK sheets 5 and 8. Flash wired straight to P2.00-P2.05. LEDs: LED0 green, LED1 amber, LED2 red. P11 = SWD header (DK Debug IN); program it from the DK's Debug OUT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
